    narr:childCount "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "ce834cb9455a1a2763cbc8a410109d52b6381eaa" ;
    narr:narration """This position holds that [reactions route through one bundle per run per person, not one message per skill](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2), restated as a [directive establishing reaction delivery policy](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_2) and again the following day in [the same routing ruling, re-voiced](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2). The window is bounded by [the bundle closing when the run closes, with a late skill waiting for the next run rather than sending on its own](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), narrated in [the pushback and ruling on the batching window](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_3) and [the same boundary held against pushback](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_3). The boundary was chosen against a [rejected alternative of per-skill delivery with client-side collapsing](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4), reported on each day in [the rejected architectural alternative](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5), [the report of the rejected alternative](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_4), and [the rejected alternative, re-reported](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_4).""" ;
    narr:reaction """The new extraction added a third-day set of children, but they restate the existing arc rather than move it: [the same routing ruling, re-voiced](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2), [the same boundary held against pushback](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_3), and [the rejected alternative, re-reported](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_4) add dates, not substance. Nothing in the prior narration was superseded; the position now reads as held across three consecutive days rather than two.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2> ;
